WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:01.434
♪ (INTENSE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:01.934 --> 00:00:05.405
Everyone thinks anarchy is,
uh... "do whatever you want."

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:08.307
SPEAKER: Anarchy just means
 self-ownership.

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:10.643
 The most peaceful ideology
 in the world.

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:13.179
SPEAKER 2: The state
 has oppressed me since birth.

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:15.247
SPEAKER 3: I was wanting
 more freedom

00:00:15.347 --> 00:00:17.183
 and wanting to be
 controlled less.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:20.720
SPEAKER 4: We wanted a pure
 anarchist life for our kids.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.989
SPEAKER 2: What they did
 in Mexico was a solution.

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:26.059
SPEAKER 4: What would you think
 about a conference in Mexico?

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:27.726
People just like you and I,

00:00:27.826 --> 00:00:28.928
 who question authority,

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:31.363
 who wanna live differently
 in Acapulco.

00:00:31.463 --> 00:00:33.032
SPEAKER 5:
 It will change your life.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:36.569
No, we don't want
anarchist people here.

00:00:37.336 --> 00:00:39.172
It's going to be fucking epic.

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:40.673
ALL: (CONSECUTIVELY)
 Anarchapulco.

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:42.141
SPEAKER 6: The biggest
 anarchist conference.

00:00:42.241 --> 00:00:44.811
A trip to Mexico,
I'm really excited.

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:47.814
SPEAKER 7:
 The world is waking up.

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:50.516
-My best friends are anarchists!
-Fuck the government.

00:00:50.616 --> 00:00:51.384
(BOOING)

00:00:51.984 --> 00:00:53.586
SPEAKER 8: Most of our people
 were buying into Bitcoin.

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:56.889
 Coming in on private jets
 and yachts.

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.458
-(CASH REGISTER DINGS)
-(HOWLS)

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:00.560
Wu-Tang Clan is here.

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:03.196
SPEAKER 4:
 This beautiful paradise

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:06.166
 can be a beacon of freedom
 for people to migrate to.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.936
And then...
the murder happened.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.105
REPORTER: An anarchist
 has been shot to death.

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:13.506
REPORTER 2:
 A tragic situation...

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:16.576
There was some sketchy stuff
happening behind the scenes.

00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:21.480
 You need to stop
 or there's going to be
 serious consequences.

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:23.983
-(SIREN WAILING)
 -You listen, or you die.

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:25.885
SPEAKER 2: I heard,
 "Bang, bang, bang."

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:27.086
SPEAKER 9: I'm scared
 out of my mind.

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:28.287
SPEAKER 10: There was
 a legitimate fear

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:30.490
 that there's a bomb
 at the conference.

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:33.460
At which point we were like,
"What the fuck?"

00:01:34.927 --> 00:01:36.095
REPORTER 3: Crypto crash.

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:38.431
We were struggling.
We were all pretty desperate.

00:01:38.864 --> 00:01:42.602
SPEAKER 10:
 It's amazing how destructive
 human beings can be

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:45.605
if they decide to not cooperate
and play nice.

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:47.907
SPEAKER 2: There's a lot
 of bloodshed in this city,

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:49.108
 just all over the place.

00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:50.677
This is real anarchy here.

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:53.480
This is not okay.
Not okay at all.

00:01:54.581 --> 00:01:56.649
SPEAKER 11: They are
 going to come after us.

00:01:57.149 --> 00:01:58.217
 We have to be strong.

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:02.088
SPEAKER 12: Is there
 a limit to the sacrifice that
 you're willing to make...

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:03.656
-(SOBS)
-No, no, no, no, no, no!

00:02:04.156 --> 00:02:05.592
...to fix the broken world?

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:07.894
JEFF BERWICK:
 The blood is in the streets.

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:10.897
What are you gonna do?

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:14.099
♪ (MUSIC CLIMAXES) ♪

00:02:14.199 --> 00:02:16.369
-Are we strong?
-(CROWD CHEERS)

